{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_033sih0174_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_033sih0174_1016_033sih", "source_sha256": "dae11274121691a456f4165a1d4d9100165c3ec0b6d945c257a71c6650ae6481", "ja": "そうですか。\nじゃあ……いいです。", "zh": "这样啊。\n那就……算了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
